    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that just feels like a way to justify more suffering. \"learning and growing\" through constant relapse is just a nicer way of saying I'm just getting better at failing. at what point is it not \"growth\" anymore, it's just torture? it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle and find any kind of peace is to just... stop. to just not have to fight anymore.",
